title the pen gets its guard, and the cadence the card cut leaves the seed
prompt Open as SILENCE under the INNER LOOP Standing block -- roster cold then hot, reds first as standfast, QA on touch, council rota row N mod 5, prose witnesses on prose sends, stamp-and-name, ASCII-first, READ SCOPE -- then pick up the running thread and take the infrastructure-Glow lane.
think ListAgents named no reachable peer, so no file move needed a peer named first (%291). The cold roster ran 74 guards in about 35 minutes and answered guards_green=72 guards_red=2 tree_at_close=e3ecb71bc342 tree_moved=no run_verdict=guard_red. Nothing was touched while it ran.
think Standfast took the lap before the lane did. declared_ceiling is REDS %295 -- tools/l/chatgpt-mind.sh:23 writes its own copy of a bound, the file is SHA-256 pinned by the MIND adaptation receipt, and it is Mind's and gated. radiant_negation was mine to close: verdict NEGATION_ROSE on three rule files against tools/fixtures/radiant_negation_baseline.txt.
think The meter counts six whole words -- not, never, no, cannot, nothing, nobody -- so the repair is register and never claim. .claude/rules/quin.md "carried by nothing in eleven days" became "left uncarried for", .claude/rules/lindy-first-crux.md "is not license to start many durable things at once" became "keeps the finishing edge in force rather than licensing many durable starts at once", .claude/rules/checkpoint.md "that room does not" became "that room stays in the field". Every claim, number and stamp held exactly; enforce_risen fell 3 to 0.
think Reading recursion-prompts/seed/autonomous-loop.seed.md for the rota grid surfaced the second red. Its section head read "The seed ships every fifth round" and its body told an unattended lap where N mod 5 == 0 to run bash ~/grain/publish-seed.sh -- the force-push that custody gate %1 holds at Keaton's hand and that construction/ITINERARY.md:217 CUT on 20260826. Six loops fill their prompts from that template and template-manifest.bron:246 scrubs the room into the public seed, so the instruction shipped both ways.
think Booking the row wanted room the pin did not have: construction/REDS.md stood at 24,569 bytes against the 24,576 its header declares, and all five living rows are OPEN so nothing was foldable. The recital's own rule answered it -- the pin keeps the three most recent pointer notes and six stood. Checking before moving them earned its keep: three of the six named shelves construction/archive/REDS-fold-recital.md had never recorded, so the record calling itself whole was missing three folds. Those three were written into the recital with links re-anchored to bare basenames first, then folded off the pin.
obs The lane keystone is a witness where none stood. comlink/rehearsal_wire.rye spawns itself three times, each child binding a UDP port on 127.0.0.1 from base_port 38498, sealing a wire_format datagram carrying its own Ed25519 signature over stamp-and-name, and reading the pen from the three facts it holds alone. It was reached by no runner, roster or suite -- it ran when a hand typed its name and at no other time -- and it is the pen FORA31 is to be proven in. tools/co/comlink_rehearsal_wire_witness.rish now builds it, proves the fleet leg (all three seats speak, all three read pen=xnvethqua), and proves the refusal leg (role q exits 2 naming the role). Both legs were planted wrong in throwaway copies and both bit by name.
obs mycelium/rehearsal.rye, the in-process half of the same rehearsal, is unreached by anything too. The constellation table is Dream's lane on this pier, so it is named here rather than taken -- a sibling-body find is a line on the card.
obs The Glow-tree charter graded A (93) at Field and stands, so no molt frame was pushed. Two of its claims have gone stale inside a day and are named rather than rewritten, since dated testimony keeps its words: its booked dual-stack defect (comlink_r1_dual_stack_witness.rish:72 running a removed .py) was repaired at 20260827.221314 by commit 4bcb8d7a8, and its step-1 ask -- the six unreached Glow witnesses -- was rostered at 20260827.183635.
obs The rota read row 3, Water/Venus, care and flow, taste: the threshold plus the shape-you-grew cardinal, the happy-zone-and-thin-edge fixed, and growing-a-language dual. The fixed seat governed the lap's own choice -- three real processes on real ports is the thin edge, so the guard is budgeted at cadence rather than run every lap.
